A CBF Garante Custeio para Mães Atletas e Consolida Direitos de Maternidade no Futebol Feminino com a Lei 15522.  Essa conquista representa um marco de reparação histórica e um forte contraponto ao Decreto-Lei nº _ _ _ _  de 1941 — que outrora proibia as mulheres de jogar futebol sob o pretexto de incompatibilidade com a maternidade;CBF Guarantees Funding for Athlete Mothers and Consolidates Maternity Rights in Women's Football with Law 15522. This achievement is a milestone of historical redress and a strong counterpoint to Decree-Law No. _ _ _ _ of 1941, which once banned women from playing football on the pretext that it was incompatible with motherhood;;1;CenaBrasilia.unity > PuzzleGeral/Puzzles/Puzzle_DF_E4/Cadeado/Totem (1)/Board_Text 2/black/Dica
